<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>ZPadder third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1b1f24; }
h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.2; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f5f6; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
li { margin: 0.15rem 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>ZPadder is built from the open-source software listed here. Each licence's text follows the
list of the components that use it. SDL 3 and the hidapi code inside it are compiled in as C
code; their licences are in the <code>licenses</code> folder next to this file.</p>
<h2>Licences used</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<h2>Licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
